{"nl": "trying to install docker but says I need to be root", "bash": "sudo apt install -y docker.io", "category": "sudo"}
{"nl": "won't let me update the package list", "bash": "sudo apt update", "category": "sudo"}
{"nl": "permission denied trying to upgrade the system", "bash": "sudo apt update && sudo apt upgrade -y", "category": "sudo"}
{"nl": "I can't install vlc says I need elevated rights", "bash": "sudo apt install -y vlc", "category": "sudo"}
